WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.840
Optimus production trims ai6 dramm to 144 gigabytes from 216 gigabytes to stretch limited memory supplies.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.800
This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 656.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:18.580
Gigaburlin's second haul, a texas night shift, and a career fair trade complaint follow, then first principles.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.600
Tesla's Optimus program, according to Big Go Finance, is absorbing ongoing memory supply constraints on the humanoid robot line.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:33.400
The adjustment sits inside broader industry pressure on high bandwidth memory as AI hardware scales at speed.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:41.240
Gigaburlin plans a December filing EVXL.co noted for a second production haul at the existing site.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:48.180
Those documents request no extra water allocations. Tesla is keeping the project inside the water permit volume

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:54.910
already approved for the first haul. Joe Tecmeier's drone footage, carried by torque news, shows rows

00:00:54.910 --> 00:01:00.550
of completed cars at Giga, Texas already staged for delivery. Outbound lots are still full of

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:06.410
new vehicles. The factory is adding a night shift through year-end. Two 12-hour shifts are now in

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:12.170
play. General Assembly still runs Monday through Thursday even with that extra shift. The Kaden

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:19.546
supports Model Y, Model YL, Cybertruck, and CyberCab production at the site. A Korean consumer group,

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:25.626
Electric reported, plans a Korea Fair Trade Commission filing over full self-driving or FSD,

00:01:26.226 --> 00:01:32.706
sold on cars that cannot legally use it. Tesla's own data shows 99% of last year's Korean imports

00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:37.546
cannot activate the feature. Only United States built vehicles qualify under the

00:01:37.546 --> 00:01:43.926
chorus trade agreement for supervised FSD operation. Shanghai built Model 3 and Model Y units

00:01:43.926 --> 00:01:48.126
make up the majority of sales and lack the required Korean regulatory approval.

00:01:48.126 --> 00:01:53.126
Tesla Korea's country manager told lawmakers that roughly 20% of registered

00:01:53.126 --> 00:01:57.727
Teslas in the country can currently run the software. Tesla opened a new

00:01:57.727 --> 00:02:02.647
engineering center, Tesla Rade said, in Berlin's Copenic district alongside the

00:02:02.647 --> 00:02:07.047
existing Gigafactory. The company is putting 100 million euros into the

00:02:07.047 --> 00:02:11.747
facility. The space adds dedicated engineering capacity for vehicle and energy

00:02:11.747 --> 00:02:16.408
programs already running at the plant. Oman is getting Tesla operations,

00:02:16.408 --> 00:02:19.968
trading view reported, scheduled for 2027.

00:02:20.328 --> 00:02:22.308
The company is building its local team

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.188
starting with sales division recruitment.

00:02:24.888 --> 00:02:27.208
Elon Musk put Oman on the regional road map

00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:31.748
in February 2017 alongside Bahrain and Saudi Arabia.

00:02:32.308 --> 00:02:36.108
Four EV chargers went into city center muskat in 2018

00:02:36.108 --> 00:02:39.128
through a partnership with Majid al-Futayim.

00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:42.988
Tesla already runs supercharger for business in Saudi Arabia,

00:02:43.488 --> 00:02:45.528
the UAE, Qatar, and Jordan.

00:02:45.528 --> 00:02:52.918
European registrations for Tesla, Shattered.io found, rose 78.6% year-to-date.

00:02:53.378 --> 00:02:56.698
Those figures run across European markets through early November.

00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:01.318
BYD posted a 111% increase over the same stretch.

00:03:02.258 --> 00:03:05.438
Previously owned Tesla cars, Body Shop Magazine found,

00:03:06.038 --> 00:03:09.098
lead used EV transaction volumes in the market it tracked.

00:03:09.738 --> 00:03:13.578
Buyer interest in those vehicles is holding relative to other electric brands.

00:03:13.578 --> 00:03:21.773
powerwall 3 gained heat pump optimization, the eco-experts reported, as a software feature owners can turn on.

00:03:22.313 --> 00:03:28.093
The over-the-air update lets the battery coordinate more efficiently with residential heating equipment during peak demand.

00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:32.526
Tesla's 2026 shareholder meeting ballot is open.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:37.826
The Tesla Motors subreddit noted, and shareholders can cast votes ahead of the annual meeting.

00:03:37.826 --> 00:03:42.066
The ballot includes re-election of Musk, Denholm, and Straubel.

00:03:42.466 --> 00:03:47.766
Ceyon Pay and PWC ratification sit with those director seats among the standard yearly

00:03:47.766 --> 00:03:48.706
governance items.

00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:54.244
Order books for Optimus Units, Auto Josh reported, are being prepared to open.

00:03:54.864 --> 00:03:59.124
That step follows continued work on the robot's AI training and hardware revisions.

00:03:59.764 --> 00:04:04.844
Agility Robotics is pursuing a public listing, Business Insider reported, as the first

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:06.984
humanoid robotics firm to take that route.

00:04:06.984 --> 00:04:12.144
food. Standard regulatory filings and investor presentations come before any initial public

00:04:12.144 --> 00:04:18.464
offering, or IPO. Scaling humanoid production takes serious capital, and larger entrants

00:04:18.464 --> 00:04:23.978
are already applying competitive pressure. From the rest of the day, Tesla, drive Tesla

00:04:23.978 --> 00:04:29.658
Canada notes, again led imported vehicle sales in South Korea for October. Automakers

00:04:29.658 --> 00:04:34.658
adding floor space in water sensitive regions now treat every extra cubic meter as a hard

00:04:34.658 --> 00:04:40.198
limit, not a figure they can bargain up. New square footage has to run on a fixed water budget.

00:04:40.698 --> 00:04:45.838
The live problem is no longer how much more water can be secured. It is how much more output

00:04:45.838 --> 00:04:51.198
the leaders already on the books can support. Cooling loops for battery formation pull from that

00:04:51.198 --> 00:04:57.518
same pool. Paint booth recirculation systems pull from it too. Final assembly rinses sit on the

00:04:57.518 --> 00:05:03.618
same fixed daily allowance. Those three families of equipment compete for every leader. Extra capacity

00:05:03.618 --> 00:05:08.818
then has to come from higher recirculation rates. It can also come from lower flow nozzles.

00:05:09.298 --> 00:05:14.418
A third path is chemistries that consume less water per vehicle. Each path carries its own

00:05:14.418 --> 00:05:19.358
capital cost and operating cost. Those trade-offs only show up once the water budget

00:05:19.358 --> 00:05:25.318
is treated as immovable. Higher recirculation needs extra filtration gear. It also needs more

00:05:25.318 --> 00:05:29.938
energy for pumping. Low water chemistries can force new supplier qualifications.

00:05:29.938 --> 00:05:35.898
The validation cycles behind those qualifications can run across multiple quarters, and outside

00:05:35.898 --> 00:05:39.218
permitting variable becomes an inside manufacturing variable.

00:05:39.778 --> 00:05:43.038
Product engineers and process engineers have to solve it together.

00:05:43.638 --> 00:05:48.558
Over time, the pattern favors plants that recapture and reuse more of what they already draw,

00:05:49.058 --> 00:05:51.918
compared with rivals who still treat water as plentiful.

00:05:52.538 --> 00:05:56.938
Sites already near their permitted limits will tilt capital toward efficiency retrofits,

00:05:56.938 --> 00:06:01.798
Copying an existing line without changing its water draw gets harder to justify.

00:06:02.398 --> 00:06:09.918
Where water rights are politically scarce or physically scarce, buying another increment of supply can cost more than redesigning the process.

00:06:10.678 --> 00:06:15.518
Internalizing that limit early can leave a lasting cost gap versus manufacturers who wait.

00:06:16.118 --> 00:06:21.458
Water ledgers will start to decide where new manufacturing floor space goes and how it is designed.

00:06:22.058 --> 00:06:25.578
Later Tesla expansions at other sites may have to walk the same path.

00:06:25.578 --> 00:06:31.418
Before we go, December is the dated step for Giga Berlin's second haul filing, and that's

00:06:31.418 --> 00:06:32.978
a wrap on today's Tesla news.

